<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-27915] Flaky AggregatePlannerTest.colocated[Algorithm = HASH]</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-27915</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Test AggregatePlannerTest.colocated&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Algorithm = HASH&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; is flaky.&lt;br/&gt;
Eventually planner skips optimal join plan and produce plan like (exchange to single):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;IgniteProject(DEPTID=[$0], CNT=[$2]): rowcount = 37500.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=3037502.0, cpu=9475002.0, memory=5150002.0, io=2.0, network=4000002.0], id = 48623
  IgniteHashJoin(condition=[=($0, $1)], joinType=[inner], variablesSet=[[]]): rowcount = 37500.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=3000002.0, cpu=9437502.0, memory=5150002.0, io=2.0, network=4000002.0], id = 48622
    IgniteExchange(distribution=[single]): rowcount = 500000.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=1000001.0, cpu=875001.0, memory=1.0, io=1.0, network=2000001.0], id = 48619
      IgniteIndexScan(table=[[PUBLIC, DEPT]], index=[DEPTID], requiredColumns=[{0}], inlineScan=[true], collation=[[0 ASC-nulls-first]]): rowcount = 500000.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=500001.0, cpu=375001.0, memory=1.0, io=1.0, network=1.0], id = 47383
    IgniteExchange(distribution=[single]): rowcount = 250000.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=1250001.0, cpu=1062501.0, memory=2250001.0, io=1.0, network=2000001.0], id = 48621
      IgniteColocatedHashAggregate(group=[{0}], CNT=[COUNT()]): rowcount = 250000.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=1000001.0, cpu=812501.0, memory=2250001.0, io=1.0, network=1.0], id = 48620
        IgniteIndexScan(table=[[PUBLIC, EMP]], index=[DEPTID], requiredColumns=[{1}], inlineScan=[true], collation=[[1 ASC-nulls-first]]): rowcount = 500000.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=500001.0, cpu=312501.0, memory=1.0, io=1.0, network=1.0], id = 47348
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instead of:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;IgniteExchange(distribution=[single]): rowcount = 37500.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=2325002.0, cpu=8762502.0, memory=5150002.0, io=2.0, network=300002.0], id = 1789
  IgniteProject(DEPTID=[$0], CNT=[$2]): rowcount = 37500.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=2287502.0, cpu=8725002.0, memory=5150002.0, io=2.0, network=2.0], id = 1788
    IgniteHashJoin(condition=[=($0, $1)], joinType=[inner], variablesSet=[[]]): rowcount = 37500.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=2250002.0, cpu=8687502.0, memory=5150002.0, io=2.0, network=2.0], id = 1787
      IgniteIndexScan(table=[[PUBLIC, DEPT]], index=[DEPTID], requiredColumns=[{0}], inlineScan=[true], collation=[[0 ASC-nulls-first]]): rowcount = 500000.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=500001.0, cpu=375001.0, memory=1.0, io=1.0, network=1.0], id = 237
      IgniteColocatedHashAggregate(group=[{0}], CNT=[COUNT()]): rowcount = 250000.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=1000001.0, cpu=812501.0, memory=2250001.0, io=1.0, network=1.0], id = 1786
        IgniteIndexScan(table=[[PUBLIC, EMP]], index=[DEPTID], requiredColumns=[{1}], inlineScan=[true], collation=[[1 ASC-nulls-first]]): rowcount = 500000.0, cumulative cost = IgniteCost [rowCount=500001.0, cpu=312501.0, memory=1.0, io=1.0, network=1.0], id = 202
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It caused by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16334&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16334&lt;/a&gt; and root cause can be fixed in Apache Calcite. Until this fix it&apos;s proposed to ignore this test. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
